      "summary": "Senator Farry issued a newsletter highlighting recent events he attended honoring veterans, including a bridge rededication and a military promotion ceremony, along with updates on legislation requiring POW/MIA flags at public schools, and informational resources for veterans covering education grants, burial benefits, national park passes, and warnings about a postcard scam targeting veterans.",
